#!args --test unit
# mdviewtest --test unit: the self-checks of the viewer's document and the list's heights
# (src/unit.rs): Markdown blocks and inline parts, HTML documents, text and HTML of ranges,
# malformed and adversarial input (nesting, runs of brackets, stars, backticks, tags, unclosed
# constructs, mutations of the samples; each within a time limit), the Fenwick sums of 100 000
# rows, the view's accessibility tree (headings with their level), forms (fields, labels,
# choices, values, the data a form sends) and images the app supplies, the element tree of HTML
# documents and its changes (queries, in place and all again, the view's place, selection,
# focus and field values kept, the cost) and the style sheets (the cascade, boxes).  The whole
# test runs before the UI starts; the exit code is the number of failures.
